# Cloned third-party repos - 272MB, each with its own .git. Deleted in P6 once
# every one of them had either code tracing to it or a recorded reason it was
# rejected; see ATTRIBUTION.md. The rule it established stays.
borrowed/

# Material we did not write and can download again: the SIH problem-statement
# catalogues, the guidelines, the official template, other teams' decks, and the
# selection-phase working files. ~23MB, none of it our work, all of it re-gettable
# from the SIH portal. Kept on disk because we still read it - out of git because
# a teammate cloning this repo needs our product, not our source material.
reference/*
!reference/README.md

# Never commit secrets
.env
.env.*
*.key

# Junk
node_modules/
__pycache__/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Credentials pasted in for testing, and screenshots of them. On disk only -
